      "id": "claim_68827cbb778c41078adcdda06270b2c7",
      "statement": "OnecommPaymentServiceProvider.instrumentRegistration dispatches on whether the request map contains a 'transaction' key: if present it runs instrumentRegistrationByTxn (lookup by last successful transaction) via OnecommGateway.searchTxn, otherwise instrumentRegistrationByCard.",
